{%- schema -%}
{
  "name": "Start a laundromat",
  "class": "starting-a-laundromat",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [ ],
    "presets": [
      {
        "name": "Start a laundromat"
      }
    ]
  }
{%- endschema -%}

<div class="p-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <ul role="list" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-2xl font-black align-center mt-5">01</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-2-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto h-auto w-1/2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline outline-offset-5" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">PLANNING & DESIGN</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will work with you to come up with a design and floor plan of your commercial space with the given area of square footage, create a store layout, and determine the placement and positioning of your laundry machines</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-5">02</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-3-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">SELECTING THE RIGHT EQUIPMENT MIX</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">The right numbers and models of washers, dryers and ironers will be assessed and selected as per your business needs and special capacity</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">03</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-4-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">FINANCING</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will assist in obtaining third-party financing options from a reputable company and help you in getting approved</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">04</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-5-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">EQUIPMENT ORDERING</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will walk you through the process to order the right brand and amount of laundry machines and equipment you need</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">05</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-6-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">CONSTRUCTION</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will work with your contractors to offer assistance to guide and organize during the construction process if required</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">06</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-7-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">INSTALLATION</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">After the construction is complete, we will come and install all the laundry machines and equipment</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">07</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-8-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">PROGRAMMING, DEMONSTRATION & MARKETING STRATEGIES</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will program the machines, give demonstrations and training to operate them and provide advertising content for marketing activities</p>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="col-span-1 flex flex-col rounded-lg bg-white border-gray-300 border-2 text-center shadow-md py-15">
      <p class="text-xl font-black align-center mt-20">08</p>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0731/2965/6514/files/laundromat-icon-9-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto size-32 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 outline -outline-offset-1" />
      <h3 class="mt-6 text-md font-medium text-gold-600">Ongoing Support</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We will provide lifelong support whether it be for machines, parts, warranties, financing, or just friendly mentorship when and wherever you may need it</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  </ul>
</div>
